            "body": {
                "serial": "i5ecb662029c78",
                "body": "\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <h1>Text Entry Interaction<\/h1>\n        <h2>The Netherlands<\/h2>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-7\">\n        <p>The Netherlands is a country with a large majority of its territory in Western Europe and several territories in the Caribbean Sea. In Europe, it borders {{i5ecb662029f67}} in the east, {{i5ecb662029fc7}} in the south, and the North Sea in the northwest.<\/p>\n        <p>The largest cities are Amsterdam, Rotterdam, The Hague, Utrecht, and Eindhoven. {{i5ecb662029fff}} is the capital, the government is located in {{i5ecb66202a033}} though.<\/p>\n        <p>Its official language is {{i5ecb66202a064}} but the province of Friesland has a secondary language, West Frisian.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"col-1\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"col-4\">\n        {{i5ecb66202a150}}\n        <p>Picture by <a href=\"https:\/\/skitterphoto.com\/photos\/843\/colorful-houses\">Rudy van der Veen<\/a>, released under <a href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\">CC0 1.0<\/a>.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  ",
